  "question": {
    "text": "The degree of dissociation of a weak monoprotic acid of concentration <math>\r <mrow>\r  <mn>1.2</mn><mtext>&#x2004;</mtext><mo>&#x00D7;</mo><mtext>&#x2004;</mtext><msup>\r   <mrow>\r    <mn>10</mn></mrow>\r   <mrow>\r    <mo>&#x2013;</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow>\r  </msup>\r  <mtext>&#x2004;</mtext><mtext>M</mtext></mrow>\r</math>\rhaving <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1.0</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>–</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup></math> is"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "1",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "10",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
