  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "D"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "By <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">α</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow></mfrac></msqrt><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><msup><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>1.2</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>1</mn><msup><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac></msqrt><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>12</mn></mrow></mfrac></msqrt></math><br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">α</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>28.86</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi></math> , as value of <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">α</mi></math> is greater than 5% so we can not take assumptions and will have to use the exact formula.<br />So <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">α</mi></math> will be given by:<br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">α</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><msup><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>1</mn><msup><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>1</mn><msup><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>×</mo><mn>1.2</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>1</mn><msup><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup></msqrt></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>1.2</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>1</mn><msup><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac></math><br />So the correct value of <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">α</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>25</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></math>"
  }
